t/openeverest/pull/2847.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Implemented the `restore delete` command to allow users to delete restore records via the Everest API.\r\n- Added flags for name, namespace, cluster, context, confirmation prompt, force deletion, ignore not found, wait for deletion, and timeout.\r\n- Integrated interactive confirmation for deletion with options to skip prompts.\r\n- Implemented logic to handle in-flight restores and provide appropriate error messages.\r\n- Added tests for various scenarios including successful deletion, not found cases, and error handling.\r\n- Updated related files to support the new delete functionality and ensure consistent behavior across commands.\r\n- Closes #2807 ","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest/issues/2847/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest/issues/2847/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest/issues/2846","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest/issues/2846/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest/issues/2846/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest/issues/2846/events","html_url":"https://github.com/openeverest/openeverest/issues/2846","id":5106135580,"node_id":"I_kwDOLA3Si88AAAABMFlyHA","number":2846,"title":"Plugin extensionPoints metadata in the CR is ignored","user":{"login":"spron-in","id":11819154,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODE5MTU0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/11819154?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spron-in","html_url":"https://github.com/spron-in","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spron-in/follower