//api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest/issues/2844/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest/issues/2844/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest/issues/2844/events","html_url":"https://github.com/openeverest/openeverest/issues/2844","id":5104876622,"node_id":"I_kwDOLA3Si88AAAABMEY8Tg","number":2844,"title":"Required <SelectInput> fields render without the required (*) marker","user":{"login":"shivansh-source","id":174698756,"node_id":"U_kgDOCmmxBA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/174698756?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shivansh-source","html_url":"https://github.com/shivansh-source","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shivansh-source/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shivansh-source/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shivansh-source/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shivansh-source/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shivansh-source/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shivansh-source/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shivansh-source/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shivansh-source/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shivansh-source/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":6392996828,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLA3Si88AAAABfQ1j3A","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working"},{"id":11716155417,"node_id":"LA_kwDOLA3Si88AAAACulZYGQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest/labels/needs-triage","name":"needs-triage","color":"ededed","default":false,"description":"Not reviewed by a maintainer yet — not ready to be worked on"}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-08-09T21:42:39Z","updated_at":"2026-08-09T21:55:49Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### What is the issue?\n\n`SelectInput` accepts an `isRequired` prop but never applies it, so required dropdowns render with no required indicator. Required text fields in the same forms *do* show one, which makes the inconsistency visible side by side.\n\n### Steps to Reproduce\n\n1. Go to **Settings → Storage Locations**\n2. Click **Add storage location**\n3. Look at the field labels in the modal\n\n**Expected:** the required **Namespace** and **Type** dropdowns show a required marker, like the other required fields in the same modal.\n\n**Actual:** both dropdowns render with no marker, while **Bucket Name** (and the other required text inputs directly below them) correctly show one.\n\n### Relevant Logs / Output\n\nNo runtime error — the prop is dropped silently, so there is nothing in the console or server logs.\n\n### OpenEverest Version\n\nv2.0.0-dev.1\n\n### Installation Method\n\nHelm\n\n### Kubernetes Distribution\n\nGKE\n\n### Environment Details\n\n_No response_\n\n### Possible Solution\n\n_No response_\n\n### Additional Context\n\n_No response_","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest/issues/2844/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest/issues/2844/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeveres