and non-verbose modes.\r\n- Add a test for `GetLogger`.\r\n- Verify logger output and configuration rather than only checking for panics.\r\n- Preserve and restore the global Zap logger between tests.\r\n\r\n## Testing\r\n\r\n- `go test ./pkg/logger/...` \r\n- `go test ./...` Existing unrelated failures in `pkg/cli/helm` and `pkg/rbac`.\r\n\r\nFixes #2827","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest/issues/2837/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/openeverest/openeverest/issues/2837/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}]